  - **Issue**: Missing or incomplete meta tags can affect SEO.
  - **Fix**: Ensure you have the necessary meta tags such as `title`, `description`, and `keywords`.

  ```html
  <head>
    <title>My Portfolio</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A professional portfolio showcasing skills, projects, and contact information.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="portfolio, skills, projects, contact, developer">
  </head>
  ```

- **Structured Data**:
  - **Issue**: Lack of structured data can impact search engine visibility.
  - **Fix**: Add structured data using JSON-LD to provide more context about your content.

  ```html
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "jobTitle": "Web Developer",
    "url": "http://www.example.com"
  }
  </script>
  ```

#### 3. **Accessibility Issues**

- **ARIA Labels**:
  - **Issue**: Missing ARIA labels can affect accessibility.
  - **Fix**: Ensure all interactive elements have appropriate ARIA labels.

  ```html
  <button aria-label="Toggle navigation">Menu</button>
  ```

