       AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/plain
       AddOutputFilterByType DEFLATE text/css
     </IfModule>
     ```

### Conclusion

By focusing on minimizing resource sizes, optimizing images, enabling compression, leveraging browser caching, reducing server response time, and optimizing JavaScript and CSS, you can significantly improve your site's speed. Regularly monitor your performance metrics using tools like Lighthouse to ensure ongoing optimization and a better user experience.

